blocks.help.event = Runs the blocks inside every time this happens. The card itself only sets it up when the script starts.
blocks.help.if = Runs the blocks inside only when the condition is true. "Else" runs when it isn't.
blocks.help.while = Repeats the blocks inside as long as the condition stays true.
