export.readme_server_player = %s - server for Flamas Player\n\nStart it: double-click "%s Server.exe" (it opens a console: type "help" for commands, "quit" to stop).\nPlayers find it in Flamas Player on this network, or join by this PC's IP. Flamas Player downloads the game from this server (only assets and Luau scripts, never programs). Over the internet, forward UDP port 29350 on the router (29351 is for finding servers on the network).\n\nMade with Flamas Engine. THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt lists the libraries it uses and their licenses.\n
export.readme_server_standalone = %s - dedicated server\n\nStart it: double-click "%s Server.exe" (it opens a console: type "help" for commands, "quit" to stop).\nPlayers find it in the game's own multiplayer menu on this network, or join by this PC's IP. Only players with the same copy of the game can join: nothing is downloaded, and Flamas Player doesn't list it. Over the internet, forward UDP port 29350 on the router.\n\nMade with Flamas Engine. THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt lists the libraries it uses and their licenses.\n
