bt.hint_root = The start of the tree: it does its only child every frame.
bt.hint_sequence = Does its children in order while they go well. One goes badly: the sequence goes badly. All well: well. The conditions before the running child are checked again every frame (a chase stops when the target is lost).
bt.hint_selector = Tries its children in order until one goes well or keeps running. Always starts from the first, so the first ones have priority.
bt.hint_randomselector = Picks its children in random order until one goes well.
bt.hint_parallel = Does all its children at the same time. Badly if any goes badly; well when all went well.
bt.hint_inverter = Its child going well = badly, and the other way around.
bt.hint_repeat = Does its child again and again (forever or some times). Badly if the child goes badly.
bt.hint_cooldown = After its child goes well, it goes badly for some seconds (attacks every 1.5 s).
bt.hint_succeeder = Always goes well when its child ends (to try something optional).
bt.hint_isnear = Well if the target is closer than the distance.
bt.hint_cansee = Well if the target is close enough, in front (inside the view angle) and nothing with physics is in between.
bt.hint_checkvar = Compares a variable of the blackboard (numbers as numbers, texts as texts).
bt.hint_chance = Goes well that percent of the times (random).
bt.hint_moveto = Walks towards the target, facing it; well when it gets to the stop distance. Sets the animation parameter "Speed".
bt.hint_patrol = Goes from waypoint to waypoint (entity names separated by commas, e.g. empty objects), waiting at each one. Never ends.
bt.hint_flee = Runs away from the target until it is farther than the safe distance.
bt.hint_wander = Walks to random points around where it started, pausing at each one. Never ends.
bt.hint_wait = Waits some seconds (random between From and To).
bt.hint_lookat = Turns until it faces the target.
bt.hint_setvar = Puts a value in a variable of the blackboard.
bt.hint_playanim = Jumps its animation graph (AnimComponent) to a state.
bt.hint_setanimparam = Sets a parameter of its animation graph (true / false / a number), or fires a trigger if the value is empty.
bt.hint_spawneffect = Spawns a particle effect where it is (name or path of a .flfx).
bt.hint_event = Tells the entity's scripts: OnBehaviorEvent(name) (attack, shout, open a door...).
bt.hint_log = Writes a message in the Log Console (to see what it is doing).
