snd.hint_output = What plays is what hangs from here. Pick this node (or an empty spot) for the whole event: volume group, 3D and distances, random volume and pitch, fades, how many copies at once and the wait between copies.
snd.hint_sound = An audio file (.wav, .ogg, .mp3, .flac). Drag files from the Resource Browser onto the canvas to create sounds (onto a container they become its children).
snd.hint_random = One of its children plays at random (by its weight), never the previous one again: footsteps, shots, hits. Looping, another one follows with no gap.
snd.hint_sequence = Its children one after another, left to right and with no gaps. Mark each child as start, loop or ending: looping, it goes back to the first one marked Loop (the start doesn't repeat), and when it is stopped the endings play.
snd.hint_layers = All its children together: an ambience made of layers (wind + birds + river). Looping, each child repeats on its own.
snd.hint_blend = All its children together, the volume of each by a value the script sends (speed, rain, danger): at a child's value that one plays fully, between two they mix.
snd.hint_switch = One at random among the children of the current state (grass / stone / water, calm / combat). The script changes the state; looping, it changes right away with a short fade. A child can be another container (for example, At random with several footsteps).
snd.no_file = (no file)
